{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36584","headline":"途中献晋州孟中丞 · 罗隐","name":"途中献晋州孟中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太平天子念蒲东，又委星郎养育功。\n昨日隼旟辞阙下，今朝珠履在河中。\n楼移庾亮千山月，树待袁宏一扇风。\n不及政成应入拜，晋州何足展清通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}